  "outstanding": [
    "The exterior highest vector in the spinor tensor is derived in EHV-01 and EHV-02. TEC-01 constructs the compact type and a model at the terminal parameter. The finite-layer mixed operator and the passage to group-invariance used for its coefficients are derived in DLA-01 through DLA-04."
